                <pb facs="0541" n="435" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg435"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Barrett to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-06-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 30,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett transmits a request of the President of Colombia that public
                    announcement be made in the United States of the preliminary negotiations
                    initiated in Colombia, and of the contemplated appointment of Sehor Enrique
                    Cortes as minister of Colombia on Secretary Root’s return from his visit to
                    South American Republics.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
